WEBVTT

00:03:56.524 --> 00:04:00.361
As a short, chubby Black kid
wearing glasses growing up,

00:04:00.361 --> 00:04:03.406
I was repeatedly told I cried too much.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.491
I’m too emotional,

00:04:05.491 --> 00:04:06.492
too soft.

00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:10.955
It was ingrained in me
that to prove my masculinity

00:04:10.955 --> 00:04:12.873
I had to display physical prowess --

00:04:12.873 --> 00:04:13.874
intimidation.

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:16.627
Because of that indoctrination,

00:04:16.627 --> 00:04:18.629
as an adult,

00:04:18.629 --> 00:04:22.425
I refused to seek help
facing escalating health challenges,

00:04:22.425 --> 00:04:24.302
including high blood pressure

00:04:24.302 --> 00:04:25.511
and mental trauma.

00:04:26.345 --> 00:04:29.307
The archetype of manhood nearly killed me.